cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AYORAI ATTRACTOR"
message: "If you use AYORAI ATTRACTOR in research or software, please cite this repository."
abstract: "AYORAI ATTRACTOR is an evidence-first verification layer for claims made by LLMs and autonomous agents. It combines deterministic verdicts, claim-level evidence provenance and reproducible audit trails for Portuguese and English workflows. The project is designed for auditable AI use in regulated environments, including LGPD-aware and financial-domain contexts."
type: software
